(F5 T5 U10: group_beam_force_moment_plasti, hinge at a node shared by
 two elements. Continuous beam of two spans of length 2 (supports at
 x 0, 2 and 4), point loads P at both mid spans, E 1, Izz 1, Mp 1.
 Elastic: moment over the middle support 3 P L / 16, the hinge there
 forms at P 2.6667 at the ends of both elements; the rotation of the
 middle node then has no stiffness (both ends plastic, the split of the
 hinge rotation is not determined) and the solver regularization of a
 zero pivot keeps its increment 0 (equilibrium Mp - Mp = 0). Collapse at
 6 Mp / L = 3. At P 2.8 each span is a simply supported beam with end
 moment Mp: mid span moment P L / 4 - Mp / 2 = 0.9, mid span deflection
 P L^3 / (48 E I) - Mp L^2 / (16 E I) = 0.216667, end reaction
 P / 2 - Mp / L = 0.9 (node_rhside sign -0.9).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
beam_rotation
end_initia
node 1 0 0 0
node 2 1 0 0
node 3 2 0 0
node 4 3 0 0
node 5 4 0 0
element 1 -beam 1 2
element 2 -beam 2 3
element 3 -beam 3 4
element 4 -beam 4 5
group_type 0 -beam
group_beam_young 0 1
group_beam_shear 0 1
group_beam_inertia 0 1 1 1
group_beam_memory 0 -total_linear
group_beam_force_moment_plasti 0  1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1  1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1e10 1
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 3 5 -ra -velx -vely -velz -rotx -roty
bounda_dof 1 -ra 2 4 -ra -velx -velz -rotx -roty
bounda_force 3 -ra 2 4 -ra -vely
bounda_time 3 0. 0. 28. -2.8 100. -2.8
control_timestep 10 1. 28.
control_timestep_iterations 10 20
control_timestep 20 1. 2.
control_timestep_iterations 20 20
target_item 0 -element_beam_force_moment 2 11
target_value 0 -1. 1.e-8
target_item 1 -element_beam_force_moment 3 5
target_value 1 1. 1.e-8
target_item 2 -element_beam_force_moment 1 11
target_value 2 0.9 1.e-8
target_item 3 -node_dof 2 -disy
target_value 3 -0.2166666666667 1.e-8
target_item 4 -node_rhside 1 -vely
target_value 4 -0.9 1.e-8
end_data
